<hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">GRIECHISCHEN KÜNSTLER.</hi></hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline><hi rendition="#k">von</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">Dr. <hi rendition="#g">HEINRICH BRUNN</hi>.</hi></byline><lb/>
